HEADER;
/*
  Component:  V-Slot wheel spacer OD 10 / bore 5 x 6
  Standard:   OpenBuilds aluminum wheel spacer (boundary dimensions)
  Family:     V-Slot wheel spacer
  Size:       
  Length:     6 mm
  Data source: Plain aluminum spacer: 10 mm OD, 5 mm nominal M5 bore, 6 mm length as listed by OpenBuilds resellers. The bore is nominal; no tolerance class is asserted.
  Notes:      Plain V-Slot wheel spacer: one analytic annular solid (true outer and inner cylinders). Bore is the nominal M5 clearance quoted by the vendor; no thread, slit, or strength claim.
  Features modeled:      outer-cylinder, inner-cylinder, flat-ends
  Features omitted:      bore-tolerance (the vendor quotes a nominal 5 mm bore; no tolerance class is asserted)
  Feature tolerance:     0.01 mm
*/
